{
  "name": "walletcap-crash-test",
  "version": "0.5.0",
  "description": "Crash-test AI agent spend limits offline: puts Coinbase CDP x402 spend controls, Spend Permissions and (opt-in) AgentKit through ordinary events such as a restart, 10 replicas or a second permission, then walletcap through the same, and counts the dollars past the cap.",
